================================================================================
1. DEFINITIONS
================================================================================

1.1 "Licensor" means Philip Bartsch (@batteryphil).

1.2 "Individual Non-Commercial User" means:
    (a) a natural person using the Covered Work solely for personal, hobbyist,
        private study, academic research, or non-monetized open-science
        purposes; or
    (b) an accredited educational institution or registered non-profit
        charitable/research organization (such as a U.S. 501(c)(3) or
        international equivalent) using the Covered Work solely for non-profit
        research or educational instruction, without commercial monetization.

1.3 "Commercial Entity" means any corporation, limited liability company,
    partnership, sole proprietorship, startup, enterprise, or other for-profit
    organization, OR any individual who uses, hosts, embeds, distributes, or
    deploys the Covered Work (or any derivative thereof) in connection with a
    revenue-generating product, paid API, SaaS platform, commercial hardware or
    edge device, paid client engagement, or internal for-profit business
    operations.

1.4 "Attributable Net Profit" means all gross commercial revenue, subscription
    fees, API usage fees, licensing fees, hardware/device margins, or direct
    monetization proceeds received by a Commercial Entity from products,
    services, or deployments that incorporate, execute, or are trained/modified
    using the Covered Work, minus documented direct third-party compute,
    hosting, or manufacturing cost of goods sold (COGS) directly incurred to
    deliver that specific product or service.

